# Solomon .env — operator-local secrets/config; never committed (gitignored).
# Copy to `.env` next to Solomon.exe / the repo root. Lines are KEY=VALUE; quotes optional.
# Every key the code reads from .env is documented here (audit finding #10).

# --- Provider API keys (the improver lanes + the CEO/MoA chat transport) ---
# Which key a lane/the CEO uses follows the configured provider in repos.json
# ("ollama-cloud" -> OLLAMA_API_KEY, "openrouter" -> OPENROUTER_API_KEY).
OLLAMA_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Multi-account key ladder (optional): a repos.json `api_key` of "OPENROUTER_API_KEY_2" /
# "OLLAMA_API_KEY_3" resolves to the same-named line here (digits-only suffix; add funded
# accounts without a code change — see improver/ctx.rs is_loadable_env_key).
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY_2=
# OLLAMA_API_KEY_2=

# Optional: override the Ollama endpoint the pi provider extension talks to.
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=

# --- Operator notifications (ntfy push + Windows toast) ---
# ntfy.sh topic for red/recovered incident pages and the CEO morning-plan/evening-report
# deliveries. Missing topic = ntfy honestly skipped (toasts still show).
NTFY_TOPIC=

# Kill-switch: set to 1 to silence ALL notifications (ntfy + toast). Unset/0 = on.
# SOLOMON_NOTIFY_OFF=
